  "body": "[Section 4.3](https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#mime-type-writing) says `text/html;` is not a valid MIME type string while referencing HTTP Semantics, but [RFC 9110 Appendix B.3](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#appendix-B.3) explicitly changed RFC 7231 to allow empty parameters via trailing semicolons.",
